# Evidence: https://github.com/yeager/translations/blob/67e6d27877c9cfd6b6dbc74bd852b10bdbe09c3c/Codeberg Weblate/verified-components/translations/qdmr/graphical-user-interface/graphical-user-interface_sv.ts
