msgid "<html><head/><body><p>Update the codeplug on the radio. If not selected, the codeplug on the radio gets overridden with possibly incomplete default values.</p><p><br/></p><p>If selected, QDMR downloads the codeplug from the radio and updates only those settings specified. The remaining settings within the radio are not touched (recommended).</p></body></html>"
